pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  - elementId: left-accent
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 60, 4, 40]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 55, 900, 40]
    content:
      fontSize: 28
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>Li 2022 — 背景 + 方案</strong></p>
  - elementId: section1-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 110, 400, 35]
    content:
      fontSize: 24
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>研究背景</strong></p>
  - elementId: section1-content
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 150, 1100, 200]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      text: |
        <ul>
        <li>云场景下 host 仍需管理资源，但不应看到 tenant workload 数据</li>
        <li>传统虚拟化中 hypervisor 可访问所有 VM 内存</li>
        <li>需要硬件级隔离保证 tenant 数据的 confidentiality 和 integrity</li>
        </ul>
  - elementId: divider
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 360, 1160, 0]
    shapeName: straightConnector1
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "$border"
  - elementId: section2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 380, 400, 35]
    content:
      fontSize: 24
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>解决方案</strong></p>
  - elementId: section2-content
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 420, 1100, 200]
    content:
      fontSize: 18
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      text: |
        <ul>
        <li>把资源管理和数据可见性分离</li>
        <li>用硬件 granule ownership 保护 Realm 内存</li>
        <li>RMM lifecycle 管理 Realm 的创建、运行、销毁</li>
        <li>GPT/GPC 实现物理地址空间的访问控制</li>
        </ul>
  - elementId: source
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 660, 1100, 25]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$secondary"
      fontFamily: "Inter, MiSans"
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>来源：Li 2022, OSDI 2022; local PDF 已核验</p>
